@* Icon.razor - Janani's line-icon set, replacing the emoji used throughout
   nav, page headings and primary buttons. One shared component rather than
   copy-pasting <svg> into 30 files: a shape only needs fixing once, and every
   icon inherits color from its surrounding text via stroke="currentColor" --
   no separate light/dark or hover/active variant to maintain.

   No new dependency (no icon font, no CDN) -- every shape is hand-drawn,
   verified by rendering icon-preview.html before any of this was wired in.
   Deliberately NOT a 1:1 icon per emoji that ever appeared anywhere in the
   app: this covers nav destinations, page headings, and the handful of
   primary-action buttons (export, share, sync, doctor) that carried a
   leading emoji. Decorative emoji inside body copy and encouragement
   text are a separate, smaller concern and are left alone. *@

<svg class="janani-icon @Class" width="@Size" height="@Size" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
     fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"
     stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    @((MarkupString)Path)
</svg>

